{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10112060","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10112060","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1011206001:1":{"text":"...<style=\"highlight\">에이론</style>?! 네가 어떻게 여기에?! 유학 간 거 아니었어!?","source_cn":"——<style=highlight>埃隆</styl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7670A1B8FF1509B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1011206002:1":{"text":"에이론은 너보다 며칠 일찍 돌아왔어. 돌아오자마자 부패한 뿌리를 제거하고 가시나무 근위대를 설득해 봉쇄령을 해제하려고 노력하고 있고.","source_cn":"埃隆他比你早回来几天，一回到丛林，就开始帮助我们清除腐...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F81134AADFB7357","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1011206003:1":{"text":"하지만 가시나무 사람들은 누구의 말도 듣지 않는 것 같아...","source_cn":"不过荆棘他们，现在好像谁的话也听不进去了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x883DAC45B876D07E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1011206003":{"text":"하지만 가시나무 사람들은 누구의 말도 듣지 않는 것 같아...","source_cn":"不过荆棘他们，现在好像谁的话也听不进去了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x883DAC45B876D07E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1011206004:0":{"text":"실례했습니다... 저는 하찮은 검객 에이론이라고 합니다.","source_cn":"真是失礼了……我是埃隆，一名还不成器的剑客。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7DDA9250ED6E0DC1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","mal